<title>USA: ADP sees 15 pct revs, earns growth for year.</title>
<headline>ADP sees 15 pct revs, earns growth for year.</headline>
<dateline>ROSELAND, N.J. 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Automatic Data Processing Inc said Monday that it expects about 15 percent growth in revenues and earnings per share for the full fiscal year.</p>
<p>The company reported earnings per share of $0.56 in the third quarter ended March 31, 1997, compared with $0.49 in the year ago period.</p>
